                  "type": "Compose",
                  "inputs": "Hi @{triggerBody()?['userName']},\n\nThank you for submitting your application through the CMDS Next Gen Provider Portal. We have successfully received your application, and it is now under review.\n\nApplication Details\nApplication ID @{triggerBody()?['applicationId']}\nSubmission Date @{formatDateTime(utcNow(),'MM/dd/yyyy')}\n\nYou can log in to the portal at any time to track the status of your application and view updates. We will notify you once the review process is completed or if any additional information is required.\n\nThank you for your submission.\n\nBest regards,\nCMDS Next Gen Provider Portal Support Team"
                },
                "Compose_3": {
